### List rosters (defaults: by name, offset 0, limit 25)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters
Accept: application/json

### Page through the list
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters?offset=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Newest season first
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters?sort=-startYear,name
Accept: application/json

### Rosters of one league (take the id from GET /leagues)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters?leagueId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Rosters of one season (take the id from GET /seasons)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters?seasonId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### One club across the seasons of a league: search by name, newest season first
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters?leagueId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&q=resovia&sort=-startYear
Accept: application/json

### Search by words of the name: any order, case and diacritics ignored
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters?q=resovia rzeszow
Accept: application/json

### Search and filters together
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters?leagueId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&q=jastrzebski&sort=-startYear&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### A query without letters or digits filters nothing
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters?q=%25
Accept: application/json

### Offset beyond the end: 200 with empty items, not an error
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters?offset=10000
Accept: application/json

### Error: unknown sort field (400, errors.sort)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters?sort=city
Accept: application/json

### Error: limit above the maximum of 100 (400, errors.limit)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters?limit=1000
Accept: application/json

### Error: negative offset (400, errors.offset)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters?offset=-1
Accept: application/json
